b><span>모든 바버가 온라인 예약을 받습니다</span></li><li><b>어린이 커트</b><span>Hollywood의 6세 미만 커트는 목–토요일에 없습니다</span></li><li><b>신용카드 가능</b><span>Patrick은 카드 가능, 다른 바버는 전화로 확인하세요</span></li><li><b>주차 공간</b></li><li><b>장애인 이용 가능</b></li><li><b>Wi-Fi</b></li><li><b>영업시간 외 예약</b><span>Hollywood와 Patrick($70부터)</span></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">갤러리</p><h2>가게에서</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/taper.jpg\" alt=\"테이퍼 페이드, 옆모습\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/design-cut.jpg\" alt=\"프리스타일 헤어 디자인\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/skin-fade.jpg\" alt=\"선명한 가르마를 넣은 스킨 페이드\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/beard-lineup.jpg\" alt=\"가게에서 한 수염 라인업\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/afro-cut.jpg\" alt=\"다듬은 아프로와 라인업\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/fade-side.jpg\" alt=\"로우 페이드, 옆모습\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/fade-pair.jpg\" alt=\"막 자른 페이드 두 개\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/chair.jpg\" alt=\"Final Kuts의 이발 의자\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">리뷰</p><h2>고객 후기</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">5.0</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 리뷰 227개</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Final+Kuts+Barbershop/@38.3559069,-121.9891209,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d0d426bd07d:0x6bc0dff565469c5b!8m2!3d38.3559069!4d-121.9891209!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google에서 리뷰 더 보기 →</a></div></div><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.9</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Booksy</b> · 리뷰 401개</div><a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/384088_final-kuts_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy에서 리뷰 더 보기 →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Best spot in town, hands down. No matter who you get, they&#39;re all great &amp; always take care of everyone that walks through the door. The atmosphere is lively &amp; the conversations are entertaining. I highly recommend everyone to check out Final Kuts.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Final%20Kuts%20Barbershop%20348%20Merchant%20St%20Ste%20A%20Vacaville%20CA%2095688\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Paul is professional, reliable and his shop is pleasant and very clean. He does an excellent job on my hair!!!!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Andrea · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/196333_hollywood-the-barber_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Oct 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“My son doesn’t like getting haircuts and Patrick was very patient and understanding. The shop is clean and always good vibes when we visit.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Final%20Kuts%20Barbershop%20348%20Merchant%20St%20Ste%20A%20Vacaville%20CA%2095688\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Feb 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Great experience. My third time going in for a cut with Mare. Friendly, professional and attentive. I am very happy with the cut. Everyone in the shop is very friendly. Great place for a cut and shave. I recommend.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Rick · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1366045_marethebarber_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Aug 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Amare took our walk-in for my 1year old son’s mullet haircut and not only perfected exactly what I wanted, but also did it in a timely manner which is critically important when cutting a child’s hair! I’m very pleased! I think I’ve found my son’s barber!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Final%20Kuts%20Barbershop%20348%20Merchant%20St%20Ste%20A%20Vacaville%20CA%2095688\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Nov 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Great service Luis is an exceptional barber who pays attention to detail. I left feeling confident highly recommend”</blockquote><figcaption>— Peezy · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1711890_luis_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Aug 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Andrew is an exceptional barber! He listened to what we needed and cut my son&#39;s hair perfectly- crisp and clean. The barbershop is friendly, comfortable professional and close to places to have a bite while you wait for someone.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Final%20Kuts%20Barbershop%20348%20Merchant%20St%20Ste%20A%20Vacaville%20CA%2095688\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Nov 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Patrick is excellent! Super friendly and chill environment”</blockquote><figcaption>— Vincent · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/593397_patrick_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Sep 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“This is a great barber shop, friendly professional and great cuts. Great for walk ins..”</blockquote><figcaption>— Johnny C. · Yelp</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Great atmosphere. My son got a regular hair cut from Paul. He was very attentive, asking questions to ensure he got what he wanted.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Arminthia S. · Yelp</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">자주 묻는 질문</p><h2>궁금한 점을 알려드려요</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>예약 없이 가도 되나요?</summary><p>네! 예약 없이 오셔도 되고, 한 살 아기도 바로 잘라 드린 적이 있어요. 기다리기 싫으시면 바버를 온라인으로 예약하세요.</p></details><details><summary>특정 바버를 어떻게 예약하나요?</summary><p>저희는 각자 예약 페이지가 있습니다: Hollywood The Barber, Patrick, Marethebarber, Luis. 위의 예약 버튼을 누르시면 됩니다.</p></details><details><summary>커트 가격은 얼마인가요?</summary><p>남성 일반 커트는 바버에 따라 $40–$45입니다. 현재 가격은 바버의 예약 버튼을 눌러 확인하세요.</p></details><details><summary>아이들 머리도 자르나요?</summary><p>네! 어린이 커트는 $35–$50입니다. Mare는 8세 이상 아이를 받고, Hollywood의 6세 미만 커트는 목요일부터 토요일까지 안 됩니다.</p></details><details><summary>영업시간 외에도 커트하나요?</summary><p>네. Hollywood는 영업시간 외 커트를 $70부터, Patrick은 영업시간 전후 커트를 $70에 합니다.</p></details><details><summary>카드 받나요?</summary><p>Patrick은 신용카드를 받습니다. 다른 바버는 (707) 685-9136으로 전화해 확인해 주세요.</p></details><details><summary>영업시간은 어떻게 되나요?</summary><p>월요일 오전 10시–오후 6시, 화–금요일 오전 10시–오후 7시, 토요일 오전 9시–오후 6시 영업하며 일요일은 쉽니다. 시간이 조금 바뀔 수 있으니 온라인으로 예약하거나 전화 주세요.</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">방문 안내</p>\n      <h2>영업시간 및 위치</h2>\n      <address>348 Merchant St Ste A<br>Vacaville, CA 95688</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17076859136\">(707) 685-9136</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>월요일</td><td>10 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>화요일</td><td>10 AM – 7 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>수요일</td><td>10 AM – 7 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>목요일</td><td>10 AM – 7 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>금요일</td><td>10 AM – 7 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>토요일</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>일요일</td><td>휴무</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">영업시간이 조금 바뀔 수 있으니 온라인으로 예약하거나 전화로 확인해 주세요.</p>\n      <div class=\"socials\"><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/final_kuts/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 2h10a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v10a5 5 0 0 1-5 5H7a5 5 0 0 1-5-5V7a5 5 0 0 1 5-5zm5 5a5 5 0 1 0 0 10 5 5 0 0 0 0-10zm0 2a3 3 0 1 1 0 6 3 3 0 0 1 0-6zm5.5-3a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0-3z\"/></svg><span>@final_kuts</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/1090522654670466\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 8h3V4h-3a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2H8v4h2v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V8z\"/></svg><span>Facebook</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/384088_final-kuts_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 2v2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2V2h-2v2H9V2H7zm-2 8h14v10H5V10z\"/></svg><span>Booksy</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Final+Kuts+Barbershop/@38.3559069,-121.9891209,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d0d426bd07d:0x6bc0dff565469c5b!8m2!3d38.3559069!4d-121.9891209!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.6-5.7 4.9 1.8 7.3L12 17.8 5.4 21.7l1.8-7.3L1.5 9.5 9 8.9z\"/></svg><span>Google reviews</span></a></div>\n      <div class=\"cta-row\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17076859136\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path 